          "kind": "MCQ",
          "points": 0.2,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Consider the following function. How many asterisks are printed by the function call quiz(5)?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">quiz</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> n)</span>\n {<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (n &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)\n    {quiz(n / <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n     quiz(n / <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n    }\n    System.out.print(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;* &quot;</span>);\n }</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Xét hàm sau. Có bao nhiêu dấu sao được in ra bởi lệnh gọi quiz(5)?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">quiz</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> n)</span>\n {<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (n &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)\n    {quiz(n / <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n     quiz(n / <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n    }\n    System.out.print(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;* &quot;</span>);\n }</code></pre></div>",
